#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-profile-history.md:27
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-profile-history.md:29
msgid ""
"This command shows what packages were added, removed or upgraded between "
"subsequent versions of a profile. It only shows top-level packages, not "
"dependencies; for that, use [`nix profile diff-closures`](./nix3-profile-"
"diff-closures.md)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-profile-history.md:34
msgid ""
"The addition of a package to a profile is denoted by the string `∅ ->` "
"_version_, whereas the removal is denoted by _version_ `-> ∅`."
msgstr ""

